      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My hands actually hurt pretty bad from having to squeeze the controller to make gestures tonight. Why do we have to squeeze for gestures at all? I'm a big fan of how Moondust and Neos handle their fingers in that the entire finger curve is handled before any grip is applied to the controller.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
